      "player": "Opus Brewer",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Silhana Wayfinder 2/1 can attack, but Brightmare 2/3 can block and kill it. The opponent's creatures all have summoning sickness though - wait, Brightmare says (sick). So actually nobody can block! Let me attack with Wayfinder for 2.\n\
\n\
Actually wait - Brightmare has summoning sickness so it CAN block (summoning sickness only prevents attacking, not blocking). So Brightmare can block my 2/1 and eat it. Not worth the trade — I lose an Elf body which matters for synergies, and Brightmare survives.\n\
\n\
