      "reasoning": "Wait — it says Turn 6 but my creatures are tapped and my lands are tapped. Let me look more carefully... Oh I see — the opponent is attacking with all 3 creatures: Brightmare (2/3), Celestial Enforcer (2/3), Anointed Chorister (1/1). That's 5 damage incoming.\n\
