However, `Elven Bow` has Flash, meaning they could cast a NEW one. But the one on board is just sitting there.\n\
Wait, if it's already on the battlefield, equipping is sorcery speed.\n\
So if I attack now with my flyer, they can't give Reach to a blocker unless they have an instant speed equip effect.\n\
\n\
Attacks:\n\
`Emancipation Angel` (3/3 flying) vs no flyers.\n\
`Brightmare` (2/3) vs `Reclamation Sage` (2/1), `Elvish Rejuvenator` (1/1). They can double block or chump.\n\
`Celestial Enforcer` (2/3).\n\
`Anointed Chorister` (1/1).\n\
\n\
If I attack with everything:\n\
Flyer goes through (3 dmg).\n\
Ground creatures get blocked.\n\
`Brightmare` (2/3) vs `Rec Sage` (2/1) -> trade.\n\
`Celestial Enforcer` (2/3) vs `Elvish Rejuvenator` (1/1) -> Rec Sage + Rejuvenator?\n\
The opponent has:\n\
`Elf Warrior Token` (tapped) - can't block.\n\
`Reclamation Sage` (2/1) - untapped.\n\
`Elvish Rejuvenator` (1/1) - untapped.\n\
