Let's get oracle text.\n\
\n\
Also `Celestial Enforcer` ability: `{1}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature. Activate only if you control a creature with flying.`\n\
I do control `Emancipation Angel` (Flying). So I can activate it.\n\
